 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The washer fluid tank is empty. Due to this I am unable to verify sprayer operation. The hood, front bumper cover, and front fenders show misalignment. I was not able to open the hood. The exterior of the vehicle was dusty at time of inspection. This can hide minor imperfections. This vehicle has excessive scratches all over the exterior. Unable to see front frame work for damages due to the limited space. The underside shows areas of surface rust. The front bumper cover and plastic inserts are damaged. The right rocker panel is loose. The windshield has a crack."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "The seats show moderate wear and soiling. The interior trim shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The carpet shows moderate wear from use. The floor mats are dirty."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "Exhaust shows some surface rust throughout, but at this time has no leaks and sounds good."
  },
  {
   "section": "Wheels/Tires",
   "text": "The wheels show scratches."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "The tire light is on. The engine had plenty of power and there were no misfires or smoking. The transmission worked as designed. The steering was responsive and the suspension was firm and the vehicle handled well. There were no abnormal vibrations or odd noises. The brakes were firm with no pulsation felt."
  }
